# The agents' memories are append-only lists of one-line lessons; two branches that each
# append lines merge by keeping both sides (git's built-in union driver), so an integration
# never stops on them. Exact duplicates are still dropped by hand (.claude/rules/subagents.md).
# Every .md there: an index (MEMORY.md) and the topic files a role splits its lessons into.
.claude/agent-memory/**/*.md merge=union
